{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forest Doesn\u2019t Care \u2014 you are alone in a real wild forest: with no hints, no GPS, and no goal except the one you choose yourself.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/43a60ae5bf875d3891341bd5cd93727a.poster.avif?t=1768059148\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/43a60ae5bf875d3891341bd5cd93727a.webm?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/43a60ae5bf875d3891341bd5cd93727a.mp4?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only you, the raw wilderness \u2014 and whatever happens to you.<br>Once, this was a calm game about walking and picking mushrooms.<br>Now it\u2019s a living system, where weather, sound, animals, and random events can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was made by just two people.<br>Brought to life \u2014 by thousands.<br>The forest doesn\u2019t care. But you shouldn\u2019t be indifferent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>A forest that feels real</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No artificial paths, no &quot;game zones&quot;.<br>Only real terrain, dense thickets, swamps, stumps, and natural routes shaped by nature itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/057bf91ff1403306ac12eccb47425771.poster.avif?t=1768059148\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/057bf91ff1403306ac12eccb47425771.webm?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/057bf91ff1403306ac12eccb47425771.mp4?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf26 <strong>Weather that won\u2019t spare you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piercing fog, cold rain, and nights where you hear more than just the wind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd8c <strong>Survival without compromises</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camping, hunting, fishing, gathering resources, inventory, cold, hunger, exhaustion \u2014 and moments of absolute peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/3c6ab0abbb397cfdae2b9da35cd83910.poster.avif?t=1768059148\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/3c6ab0abbb397cfdae2b9da35cd83910.webm?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udee5 <strong>Strange discoveries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a horror game, but sometimes the forest behaves as if it has a will of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/a568c8ef93849047ca4847720a6bf8e3.poster.avif?t=1768059148\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/a568c8ef93849047ca4847720a6bf8e3.webm?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/a568c8ef93849047ca4847720a6bf8e3.mp4?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk together, survive together, argue by the campfire, hide from the rain, laugh when someone slips into the river.<br>The forest doesn\u2019t care.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Sound that creates atmosphere better than words</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birds, crunching branches, wind\u2026 and that distant \u201csomething\u201d that makes you want to turn around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/f1d62e8edc906f78b6b9e1107c844d73.poster.avif?t=1768059148\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/f1d62e8edc906f78b6b9e1107c844d73.webm?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/f1d62e8edc906f78b6b9e1107c844d73.mp4?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forest Doesn\u2019t Care doesn\u2019t hold your hand.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It simply throws you into the wild \u2014 and watches what you\u2019ll do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to explore, survive, get lost, find something unexplainable, or just sit on a stump and watch the fog \u2014 this game is for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>## Developer\u2019s Note</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is not just an atmospheric walk through the forest and mushroom collecting\u2014it is also an experiment with the modern capabilities of Unreal Engine 5. I used procedural generation, Nanite, Lumen, textures up to 8\u201316 K, and a vast amount of geometry to recreate the most alive and detailed nature.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a fully solo project made from scratch. For me, this game is proof that even one person can realize a dream using modern tools. If you\u2019ve ever dreamed of making games too\u2014don\u2019t be afraid, start making them!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Spore Seeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/73f6bd4f8adb93364699f3be9f0b1f342e699f65.jpg"},{"name":"Bronze Forager","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/5135803dc103b90225106336641eb441c91bb428.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Mycophile","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/14542a688b490b62de91a9ceadca05b90a4e0390.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Shroommaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/ae83083c2dafafbf8482fb31ee1563672479abe4.jpg"},{"name":"Surrounded, yet unbroken.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/86424ebfc8ed4a972ba4ecba960cff5d112899a4.jpg"},{"name":"Aerophobia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/3f910398f6c25f25d22cca6be9150c370c2ed5b6.jpg"},{"name":"Very strange things","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/c6053a6e7005967957cee685da9319cb37b2f3b4.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/c8ec8c6051628b640a1cfe6f761ee144fd8c2fe4.jpg"},{"name":"A bear\u2019s kiss.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/cad1d62eed79ff0ee4e7bc8153e688531b4fd708.jpg"},{"name":"Mom, let me be born again.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922100/fa1bf9cc4c9c0abff4164d75f6f0c6ba26fd574e.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922100?t=1768059148","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/8e4e0ed4965c10b1280b9acd5f8dd80031b15031/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768059148","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/231bdb733e81c259dce0be35beddd5827343ca70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768059148","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/231bdb733e81c259dce0be35beddd5827343ca70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768059148","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>What Awaits You in the Next Update:</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROADMAP: NEXT UPDATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who supported the game and helped us launch the big December Update. Your energy keeps us going \u2014 seriously, we appreciate every one of you. \u2764\ufe0f<br>Now let\u2019s talk about what\u2019s coming next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Polishing the new content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the upcoming weeks, we\u2019ll focus on polishing everything we\u2019ve added: fishing, survival, the hunger system, new items, and the updated progression.<br>Our goal is to make all mechanics stable, smooth, and enjoyable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Localization improvements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the next few days, we\u2019ll update the game\u2019s localization: fix inaccuracies, add translations for new content, and clean up the overall text quality.<br>Thank you to everyone who pointed out errors \u2014 your attention really helps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your feedback = our fuel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is now a <strong>REPORT BUG</strong> button in the pause menu \u2014 please use it.<br>The more we know about bugs and weird behavior, the faster we can fix them. Your feedback truly makes a difference.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We\u2019re just two people</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be completely honest: the entire game is being developed by <strong>just two guys</strong>.<br>We put everything we have into this project, but we physically can\u2019t keep the same pace as big studios \u2014 and we really appreciate your patience and support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re an artist, animator, programmer, sound designer, or simply an enthusiast who wants to help \u2014 reach out.<br>We\u2019re open to people who feel connected to the game\u2019s atmosphere and want to join a small indie project that grows together with its community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Regular patches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect weekly patches with fixes, optimizations, and small improvements.<br>Once we stabilize the December Update, we\u2019ll announce the date of the next major update.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forest Doesn\u2019t Care \u2014 you are alone in a real wild forest: with no hints, no GPS, and no goal except the one you choose yourself.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/43a60ae5bf875d3891341bd5cd93727a.poster.avif?t=1768059148\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/43a60ae5bf875d3891341bd5cd93727a.webm?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/43a60ae5bf875d3891341bd5cd93727a.mp4?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only you, the raw wilderness \u2014 and whatever happens to you.<br>Once, this was a calm game about walking and picking mushrooms.<br>Now it\u2019s a living system, where weather, sound, animals, and random events can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was made by just two people.<br>Brought to life \u2014 by thousands.<br>The forest doesn\u2019t care. But you shouldn\u2019t be indifferent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>A forest that feels real</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No artificial paths, no &quot;game zones&quot;.<br>Only real terrain, dense thickets, swamps, stumps, and natural routes shaped by nature itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/057bf91ff1403306ac12eccb47425771.poster.avif?t=1768059148\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/057bf91ff1403306ac12eccb47425771.webm?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/057bf91ff1403306ac12eccb47425771.mp4?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf26 <strong>Weather that won\u2019t spare you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piercing fog, cold rain, and nights where you hear more than just the wind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd8c <strong>Survival without compromises</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camping, hunting, fishing, gathering resources, inventory, cold, hunger, exhaustion \u2014 and moments of absolute peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/3c6ab0abbb397cfdae2b9da35cd83910.poster.avif?t=1768059148\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/3c6ab0abbb397cfdae2b9da35cd83910.webm?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udee5 <strong>Strange discoveries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a horror game, but sometimes the forest behaves as if it has a will of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/a568c8ef93849047ca4847720a6bf8e3.poster.avif?t=1768059148\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/a568c8ef93849047ca4847720a6bf8e3.webm?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/a568c8ef93849047ca4847720a6bf8e3.mp4?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk together, survive together, argue by the campfire, hide from the rain, laugh when someone slips into the river.<br>The forest doesn\u2019t care.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Sound that creates atmosphere better than words</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birds, crunching branches, wind\u2026 and that distant \u201csomething\u201d that makes you want to turn around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/f1d62e8edc906f78b6b9e1107c844d73.poster.avif?t=1768059148\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/f1d62e8edc906f78b6b9e1107c844d73.webm?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922100/extras/f1d62e8edc906f78b6b9e1107c844d73.mp4?t=1768059148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forest Doesn\u2019t Care doesn\u2019t hold your hand.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It simply throws you into the wild \u2014 and watches what you\u2019ll do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to explore, survive, get lost, find something unexplainable, or just sit on a stump and watch the fog \u2014 this game is for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>## Developer\u2019s Note</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is not just an atmospheric walk through the forest and mushroom collecting\u2014it is also an experiment with the modern capabilities of Unreal Engine 5. I used procedural generation, Nanite, Lumen, textures up to 8\u201316 K, and a vast amount of geometry to recreate the most alive and detailed nature.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a fully solo project made from scratch. For me, this game is proof that even one person can realize a dream using modern tools. If you\u2019ve ever dreamed of making games too\u2014don\u2019t be afraid, start making them!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["MOROZ GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_